      en: ["Longest river flowing entirely within Greek territory (297 km).", "Originates in the Grammos Mountains at 2,500 meters altitude.", "Discharges into the Thermaic Gulf of the Aegean Sea.", "Lake Polyfytos is the river's largest reservoir.", "Historically mentioned in the works of Herodotus.", "The Aliakmon Delta is a protected Natura 2000 site."],
