      hu: ["Az Enipeasz-folyó teljes hossza megközelítőleg 10 kilométer.", "A víz hőmérséklete nyáron is ritkán emelkedik 10 fok fölé.", "A közelben található az 1542-ben alapított régi Szent Dionüsziosz kolostor.", "Az európai E4-es vándorút közvetlenül az Enipeasz-szurdokon halad át.", "A szurdok mélysége bizonyos pontokon eléri a több száz métert.", "A legenda szerint Orpheuszt itt tépték szét a bakkhánsnők."],
      ro: ["Râul Enipeas are o lungime totală de aproximativ 10 kilometri.", "Temperatura apei rareori depășește 10 grade Celsius, chiar și vara.", "În apropiere se află vechea mănăstire Agios Dionysios, datând din 1542.", "Traseul european de drumeție E4 trece direct prin cheile Enipeas.", "Cheile ating o adâncime maximă de câteva sute de metri în unele puncte.", "Conform legendei, muzicianul Orfeu a fost ucis de menade în aceste locuri."],
      en: ["The Enipeas River has a total length of approximately 10 kilometers.", "The water temperature rarely exceeds 10 degrees Celsius, even in summer.", "The historic Old Monastery of Agios Dionysios, built in 1542, is located nearby.", "The E4 European long-distance path runs directly through the Enipeas Gorge.", "The gorge reaches a maximum depth of several hundred meters in sections.", "According to legend, the musician Orpheus was killed by the Maenads here."],
